# Leohichou's GitHub Configs

Welcome to my GitHub configuration repository! 🚀 This repo contains various configuration files that help streamline my development workflow.

## 📂 Contents

- **`.gitconfig`** – My global Git configurations.
- **`.editorconfig`** – Standardized coding styles across different editors.
- **`.prettierrc`** – My preferred Prettier settings.
- **`.eslintrc`** – Custom ESLint configurations for JavaScript/TypeScript projects.
- **`settings.json`** – My VS Code settings.
- **`.bashrc` / `.zshrc`** – Terminal configurations and aliases.

## 🛠️ Setup

Clone this repository and symlink the configs you want to use:

```sh
git clone https://github.com/leohichou/github-config.git ~/.github-config
ln -s ~/.github-config/.gitconfig ~/.gitconfig
ln -s ~/.github-config/.editorconfig ~/.editorconfig
# Add more as needed...
```
